<title>UK: New Zealand sets $150 millin five-year bond.</title>
<headline>New Zealand sets $150 millin five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HM THE QUEEN IN THE RIGHT OF NEW ZEALAND</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY  * 09.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.95     PAY DATE    09.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	+26 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE 09.JUL.99 AT PAR</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NZ	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    12.5 BP   SELL CONC  12.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
